### ─── PropertyLoop Error & Edge Cases ────────────────────────────────────────
### Login tokens
# @name loginBuyer
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{buyerEmail}}",
  "password": "{{buyerPassword}}"
}

# @name loginAgent
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{agentEmail}}",
  "password": "{{agentPassword}}"
}

# @name loginVendor
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{vendorEmail}}",
  "password": "{{vendorPassword}}"
}
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### AUTH ERRORS
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### ═══ 1. No token (expect 401) ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

### ═══ 2. Invalid token (expect 401) ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer totally.fake.token

### ═══ 3. Missing required fields (expect 400) ═══
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "No Email"
}

### ═══ 4. Agent signup without agent data (expect 400) ═══
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bad Agent",
  "email": "bad.agent@test.com",
  "password": "{{buyerPassword}}",
  "role": "AGENT"
}
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### ROLE ENFORCEMENT
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### ═══ 5. Buyer tries agent endpoint (expect 403) ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/agents/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}

### ═══ 6. Buyer tries vendor endpoint (expect 403) ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/vendors/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}

### ═══ 7. Agent tries vendor jobs (expect 403) ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/vendor-jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAgent.response.body.accessToken}}

### ═══ 8. Vendor tries to create listing (expect 403) ═══
POST {{baseUrl}}/listings
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVendor.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test",
  "type": "SALE",
  "propertyType": "House",
  "priceNaira": 100000000,
  "address": "Somewhere",
  "location": "Lagos",
  "beds": 3,
  "baths": 2,
  "sqft": "2000",
  "yearBuilt": "2024",
  "description": "Test",
  "features": [],
  "coverImage": "https://example.com/img.jpg",
  "images": []
}

### ═══ 9. Vendor tries to create lead (expect 403) ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/leads
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVendor.response.body.accessToken}}
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### OWNERSHIP ENFORCEMENT
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### ═══ 10. Buyer tries to update agent's listing (expect 403) ═══
# Get a listing ID first
# @name someListings
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings?limit=1

###
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/listings/{{someListings.response.body.items[0].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "priceNaira": 1
}
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### NOT FOUND
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### ═══ 11. Listing not found (expect 404) ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings/nonexistent-id-12345

### ═══ 12. Agent not found (expect 404) ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/agents/nonexistent-id-12345

### ═══ 13. Vendor not found (expect 404) ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/vendors/nonexistent-id-12345
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### STATE MACHINE VIOLATIONS
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### ═══ 14. Try to start a PENDING job (should fail — must accept first) ═══
# Create a job first
# @name badStateJob
POST {{baseUrl}}/vendor-jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vendorId": "{{loginVendor.response.body.user.id}}",
  "title": "State machine test",
  "description": "Testing invalid state transition",
  "address": "Test address",
  "vendorFee": 10000,
  "scheduledFor": "2026-05-01T10:00:00.000Z",
  "clientName": "Tester",
  "clientPhone": "+2340000000000"
}

### Expect 400 — can't start a PENDING job
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/vendor-jobs/{{badStateJob.response.body.id}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVendor.response.body.accessToken}}

### Expect 400 — can't complete a PENDING job
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/vendor-jobs/{{badStateJob.response.body.id}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVendor.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "completionNotes": "Tried to skip"
}

### Expect 400 — buyer can't confirm a PENDING job
POST {{baseUrl}}/vendor-jobs/{{badStateJob.response.body.id}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}

### Cleanup — decline it
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/vendor-jobs/{{badStateJob.response.body.id}}/decline
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVendor.response.body.accessToken}}
